chapter.v:
you with 


your own, 


hand drove out the nations, but them you planted; you afflicted the peoples, but them you set free;

Our heart 


has not, 


turned back, nor have our steps departed from your way;

Rise up; 


come to, 


our help! Redeem us for the sake of your steadfast love! Footnotes (1) 44:1 Probably a musical or liturgical term (2) 44:14 Hebrew *a shaking of the head* (ESV)
